<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>. </span><span id="S3.T2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Main results on downstream task applications, spanning Embodied AI (ALFWorld), Online Shopping (WebShop), General AI Assistants (GAIA), and Humanity’s Last Exam (HLE). We report Pass@1 for all tasks. For 32B models, the best results are in <span id="S3.T2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> and the second are <span id="S3.T2.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. Results from larger or closed-sourced models are in <span id="S3.T2.7.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#535353;">gray</span> color for reference. </span></figcaption>
